    <string name="model_gigaam_desc">The best model for Russian speech (Sber): punctuation and capitalization, about half the errors of Whisper and 4–5× faster. Russian only.</string>
    <string name="model_gml_title">Uzbek (+ Russian, Kazakh) — GigaAM Multilingual</string>
    <string name="model_gml_desc">Multilingual GigaAM: Uzbek (~10–14% word error rate; plain Whisper barely works for Uzbek), plus Russian and Kazakh. No punctuation, lowercase. Detects the language itself.</string>
    <string name="model_whisper_title">English and other languages — Whisper Small</string>
    <string name="model_whisper_desc">OpenAI Whisper (99 languages). Good for English; Russian is worse than GigaAM, Uzbek is very poor (use GigaAM Multilingual). Language is chosen below. 4–5× slower than GigaAM.</string>
